<Patch>

	<!--
		Too Many Mods' implant rebalance: implant and prosthetic stats. Moved whole from the core root file AA1D1_ImplantRebalance.xml, where it sat behind the
		TMM_ImplantRebalances setting (default on); installing this mod is the opt-in now.
		Each block is gated on the mods it touches (MayRequire / MayRequireAnyOf on an <li>); mods with no known packageId keep a
		name FindMod; blocks that depend on another mod being present or absent now live in gated load folders (loadFolders.xml). Checked with analysis/patch_sim.py against the installed mods:
		every op whose mods are installed applies. Blocks for mods not installed here are unchecked.
	-->
